DESCRIPTION:Harry Lehman is an aging pickpocket who plies his trade with e
 ver-diminishing returns in a drastically changed New York. Wallets stuffe
 d with cash have been replaced by easily cancelled credit cards\, and Har
 ry struggles to make ends meet as he cares for his disabled wife\, Rosie.
